    "identifier": "2-point-penetrate",
    "description": "<p>You perform a double strike attacking at your opponent’s shoulders or legs in an attempt to destabilize them. Make two melee taijutsu attacks dealing your [Weapons damage].</p>\n<p>Chain 1: If a target is hit at least once, it must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, they suffer a 10-foot speed penalty for each successful attack, until the end of their next turn.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d6.</p>",
